{"3484040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Accord", "steam_appid": 3484040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/806613380db17bd3f8a4056dcf78ac74.poster.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/806613380db17bd3f8a4056dcf78ac74.webm?t=1775745818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/33a3cb11d99c0d18002f5d05d6c9997a.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood accord is a story inspired by the authors' personal experiences and the creepypasta about Saki Sanobashi, a non-existent anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5f1182c6d4e96da95552fe3beeb7dfcf.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana wakes up locked inside a public restroom with her two closest friends. There's Vika, fiery and sharp-tongued, a fearless spirit. And Lala, gentle and warm-hearted, a soul that craves harmony. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana is relieved at first. She's not alone. These are the girls she loves more than life itself, and being together again feels like a blessing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as time drags on, the tight space feels less like a refuge and more like a cage. The air thickens with unspoken tension, and long-buried secrets claw their way to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As blood drips from the rusted tap, the past refuses to stay forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/14765b5da02481b25e520bcb5a3176c0.poster.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/14765b5da02481b25e520bcb5a3176c0.webm?t=1775745818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then... she wakes with a jolt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a <strong>dream</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange, unsettling dream. But still just a dream... Or is it? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet light of her apartment, Yana feels lost and unsure. The cold glow of her computer screen is her only connection to reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can she find answers in her messages, forgotten journal notes, and memories? Will online strangers' advice help her solve the mystery before it’s too late? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5985c82f9fd8b9a1740a34fcd94cda9f.poster.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5985c82f9fd8b9a1740a34fcd94cda9f.webm?t=1775745818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her time is running short: the truth awaits, but its price may be more than she can bear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/e25c2b0cf51fdd37434f12f7d7c22977.poster.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/e25c2b0cf51fdd37434f12f7d7c22977.webm?t=1775745818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/72b0e548cf0097a15ccfbce9ac6660a3.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> Over 90 minutes of playtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Branching paths and moral decisions. Your choices have consequences for Yana and her world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Experience:</strong> Interact with Yana's computer. Explore files, read messages, and discover her past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> A human story about uncertainty and the search for meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layered Narrative:</strong> A story with multiple interpretations and hidden meanings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced in Russian</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature Content:</strong> extreme gore, despairing madness, and excessive bloodshed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/580b8e5234251c555e11431a43c2187a.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/5a50991b2e2af7ec8ff0880036780cdb.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nothing happened. Everything is fine. We are still friends.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressively attached. She's not easy for those around her. Why? She's forbidden us from telling you about herself. You'll find out everything in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yana desperately needs friends, and we sincerely hope you'll get along with her. She is at her breaking point. Will you lead her to salvation or destruction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/f3b3b7d37c3f0a73c321488c1668d2fb.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Maybe if we just talk it out... No, never mind.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An innocent soul lost in a sea of madness. Gentle, kind, and always trying to keep the peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will she stay this sweet, or will the shadows within her rise to consume Yana?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/85b63f3ef23fe0361aa0a481a7ceeed8.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If honesty is 'mean,' then yeah, I'm the villain. Get over it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's just say she's...extra. From her &quot;business casual&quot; attire (a bra as a top? For real?) to her explosive, impulsive personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vika's about to unleash a hurricane of drama. And...how does she really feel about Yana?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484040/extras/a04ca54bf2bcf422405f13df4a16eb2a.avif?t=1775745818\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\